      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是这样的话，\n就只好拜托宝可梦了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F8FD9683776848BDDFF0C000A5C3153EA597D62DC62585B9D53EF68A64E863002001000020114015A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宝可梦的招式分为\n物理招式和特殊招式。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n从能力查看招式的时候，\n标记看起来尖尖刺刺的，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就是物理招式。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B9D53EF68A6768462DB5F0F52064E3A000A7269740662DB5F0F548C72796B8A62DB5F0F300200100001BE01000A4ECE80FD529B67E5770B62DB5F0F768465F65019FF0C000A68078BB0770B8D7767655C165C16523A523A7684FF0C00100001BE00000A5C31662F7269740662DB5F0F3002001000020114015A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果让宝可梦用格斗属性的物理招式\n攻击全息传送梯，说不定就能修好了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C8BA95B9D53EF68A67528683C65975C5E602776847269740662DB5F0F000A653B51FB5168606F4F20900168AFFF0C8BF44E0D5B9A5C3180FD4FEE597D4E86FF01001000020114015A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
